---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Join Us">
  <main class="wrap">
    <h2>Join us</h2>
    <p class="lead">We are always looking for motivated MS or PhD students interested in our
      research. You can also get involved through internships and project staff positions.</p>

    <h3>PhD positions</h3>
    <p>We accept students as part of the three-institute Joint Degree (BMD) programme with the
      Indian Institute of Technology Madras (IITM), Sree Chitra Tirunal Institute for Medical
      Sciences and Technology, Trivandrum (SCTIMST) and Christian Medical College, Vellore (CMC).
      Application details are on the{' '}
      <a href="https://research.iitm.ac.in/jdp.html">IITM website</a>.</p>

    <h3>MS / MTech programmes</h3>
    <p>We have two postgraduate programmes focusing on clinical and engineering research: the{' '}
      <a href="https://bioe-cmcvellore.weebly.com/ms-bioengineering.html">MS in Bioengineering</a>{' '}
      and the{' '}
      <a href="https://bioe-cmcvellore.weebly.com/mtech-clinical-engineering.html">MTech in Clinical Engineering</a>.
      Application details are on the{' '}
      <a href="https://bioe-cmcvellore.weebly.com/academics.html">Bioengineering department website</a>.</p>

    <h3>Fellowships and project staff positions</h3>
    <p class="muted">No funded positions at the moment.</p>
  </main>
</Base>
